    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">rhmr() was depreciated and then removed.  Use rhwatch() instead.  It is rhmr() with more functionality and more organized monitoring of MapReduce jobs.  It basically starts and watches jobs for you.</div>"
    ],
